//------------------------------------------------------------------
// Rules
//------------------------------------------------------------------

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_RulesPrompt
What would you like to know\nabout the [BUFFER1]?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ChoiceFrontierRules
Frontier Rules

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ChoiceFacilityRules
Facility Rules

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CommonRules
At the Battle Frontier, you'll take\non challengers one after another.\pEvery Pok\emon battles at level 50\nand is healed before each fight.\pAs you win, your streak will grow\nand you'll face stronger trainers.\pYou'll earn Pok\e Chips for each win.\nJust remember you can only hold\lup to 999 Pok\e Chips at a time!\pIf you ever need a break, you can\nRest - we'll save your streak and\lhold it until you return.\pPlease make sure to complete a\nbattle before resting - otherwise\lyour streak will be lost!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_TowerRules
The Battle Tower plays it straight -\nno gimmicks, no special conditions.\pJust you, your team, and one\nchallenger after another.

//------------------------------------------------------------------
// Choosing a format and entering a team
//------------------------------------------------------------------

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ChooseFormat
Which format would you like to\nchallenge?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ChoiceSingles
Singles

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ChoiceDoubles
Doubles

// Swapped in for the two above when that format has a run waiting to be picked back up.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ChoiceSinglesOnHold
Singles (on hold)

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ChoiceDoublesOnHold
Doubles (on hold)

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ConfirmChallenge
The [BUFFER1], [BUFFER2] format.\pYou'll need to enter [BUFFER3] Pok\emon.\pShall we begin?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ChooseTeam
Please choose the Pok\emon you'd\nlike to enter.

//------------------------------------------------------------------
// Battles
//------------------------------------------------------------------

// Fallbacks only - in a Frontier battle the engine prints the opponent's own
// lines from the trainer table instead of these.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_OpponentDefeated
I couldn't keep up with you!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_OpponentVictorious
Better luck next time!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_WinReward
That's [BUFFER3] straight in the\n[BUFFER1]!\pHere are [BUFFER2] Pok\e Chips for\nyour trouble.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_WinRewardCaseFull
That's [BUFFER3] straight in the\n[BUFFER1]!\pYou'll have to spend some Pok\e Chips\nto make room for more!

//------------------------------------------------------------------
// Continue / Rest / Give up
//------------------------------------------------------------------

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ChallengeMenuPrompt
Your [BUFFER1] [BUFFER2] streak\nstands at [BUFFER3].\pWould you like to continue?

// The two below replace the prompt above when a milestone battle is next, so the player is
// never surprised into one - see FrontierChallenge_GetNextOpponentKind.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ChallengeMenuPromptAce
Your [BUFFER1] [BUFFER2] streak\nstands at [BUFFER3].\pA word of warning - an especially\nstrong Trainer is next up.\pWould you like to continue?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ChallengeMenuPromptBrain
Your [BUFFER1] [BUFFER2] streak\nstands at [BUFFER3].\pWaiting in the next room is\nthe master of the [BUFFER1]\lthemselves!\pWould you like to continue?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ChoiceContinue
Continue

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ChoiceRest
Rest

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ChoiceAbandon
Give up

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ConfirmRest
We'll save your progress and hold\nyour streak until you come back\lfor it.\pYou're free to go wherever you\nlike in the meantime - even to\lanother facility.\pWould you like to Rest?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Resting
We'll be waiting for you!

//------------------------------------------------------------------
// Picking a run back up
//------------------------------------------------------------------

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_WelcomeBackRested
Welcome back to the [BUFFER1]!\pYour [BUFFER2] streak of [BUFFER3]\nis right where you left it.\pFeel free to bring a different\nteam this time, if you like.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_OnHoldMenuPrompt
What would you like to do with it?

// Variant for when a player resumes before an Ace/Brain
#org @gText_BattleFrontier_OnHoldMenuPromptSpecial
Before you decide - an especially\nstrong Trainer is up next.\pWhat would you like to do?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_OnHoldMenuPromptBrain
Before you decide - waiting in the\nnext room is the master of the\l[BUFFER1] themselves.\pWhat would you like to do?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ChoiceKeepOnHold
Nothing

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ResumeWarning
Then let's pick up where you left\noff!\pJust remember[.] Once the next battle\nbegins, you'll have to see it\lthrough.\pStopping partway will cost you\nyour streak.\pWith that said, let's begin[.]

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ConfirmAbandon
Giving up will end your run, and\nyour [BUFFER1] [BUFFER2] streak of\l[BUFFER3] will be lost.\pAre you sure?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Abandoned
Thank you for challenging the\n[BUFFER1]!\pWe hope to see you again.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Lost
Your [BUFFER1] challenge\nhas come to an end.\pThank you for battling, and please\ncome again!
